        "height": 0.032222
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_20",
      "text": "World",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.870953,
        "y": 0.162222,
        "width": 0.04100499999999996,
        "height": 0.032222
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_21",
      "text": "Technology",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.914041,
        "y": 0.162222,
        "width": 0.06443100000000002,
        "height": 0.032222
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_22",
      "text": "Analysis",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.184028,
        "y": 0.471111,
        "width": 0.043011999999999995,
        "height": 0.013332999999999984
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_23",
      "text": "The next phase of the AI platform race is about distribution",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.184028,
        "y": 0.494444,
        "width": 0.409852,
        "height": 0.06444400000000006
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_24",
      "text": "Enterprise buyers are consolidating vendors, and the advantage is shifting from raw model quality to deployment reach.",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.184028,
        "y": 0.573333,
        "width": 0.409852,
        "height": 0.043332999999999955
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_25",
      "text": "By Jordan Lee · 8 min read",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.184028,
        "y": 0.633333,
        "width": 0.114453,
        "height": 0.01777799999999996
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_26",
      "text": "Markets",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.237778,
        "width": 0.041439000000000004,
        "height": 0.013332999999999984
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_27",
      "text": "Chipmakers lead a cautious rebound after overnight losses",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.257778,
        "width": 0.272081,
        "height": 0.018766999999999978
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_28",
      "text": "Global desks remain focused on supply guidance and demand visibility into next quarter.",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.282101,
        "width": 0.272081,
        "height": 0.03420099999999998
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_29",
      "text": "6 min read",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.328524,
        "width": 0.03556899999999996,
        "height": 0.013332999999999984
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_30",
      "text": "Cities",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.38408,
        "width": 0.028895000000000004,
        "height": 0.013332999999999984
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_31",
      "text": "A transit network rebuild inches toward its first passenger milestone",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.40408,
        "width": 0.272081,
        "height": 0.037534999999999985
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_32",
      "text": "Engineers completed overnight tests on the eastern corridor earlier this week.",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.44717,
        "width": 0.272081,
        "height": 0.03420099999999998
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_33",
      "text": "4 min read",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.493594,
        "width": 0.03561199999999998,
        "height": 0.01333300000000004
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_34",
      "text": "Science",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.549149,
        "width": 0.037826000000000026,
        "height": 0.01333300000000004
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_35",
      "text": "Researchers map how urban trees change peak summer temperatures",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.569149,
        "width": 0.272081,
        "height": 0.037534999999999985
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_36",
      "text": "Street-level sensors recorded differences of up to 3.2 degrees across neighborhoods.",
      "bbox": {
        "x": 0.700825,
        "y": 0.61224,
        "width": 0.272081,
        "height": 0.03420100000000004
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "text_37",
